@startuml MARS-OPS-Mission-State
title MARS-OPS - Mission Lifecycle

hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> CREATED : new Mission(...)

CREATED --> ASSIGNED : submitMission()\n[all checks pass]\n/ assign(agents)
CREATED --> FAILED : submitMission()\n[a check fails]\n/ fail(reason)

ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS : advanceTime()\n/ start()
IN_PROGRESS --> IN_PROGRESS : advanceTime()\n[elapsed < duration]\n/ tick()
IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : advanceTime()\n[elapsed >= duration]\n/ complete()

ASSIGNED --> FAILED : [blocked by environment\nor equipment failure]\n/ fail(reason)
IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED : [blocked by environment\nor equipment failure]\n/ fail(reason)

COMPLETED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*]

note right of FAILED
  A failed mission cannot be retried:
  create a new mission object.
end note
@enduml
